    "upstream": "SKILL.md §Failure handling",
    "body": "## Failure handling\n\n- **Search failed / engine unavailable:** say so plainly; do not answer as if evidence existed. Give your reasoning labeled as UNVERIFIED and end with one RESEARCH_REQUEST.\n- **Source shortfall:** refine the question, date range, terminology, or domains. Do not lower quality merely to reach a number.\n- **Incomplete metadata:** use what the page shows; never fill the gaps from memory.\n- **Paywalled source:** report that only accessible metadata/abstract text was reviewed.\n- **Systematic-review request:** scope it as its own agenda item instead of doing it inside one turn."
